    <item>
      <title>华为CloudMatrix 384：重构AI算力范式，国产替代加速下的系统级效率革命</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/cloudmatrix-384ai-20251027221010922-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 22:10:10 +0800</pubDate>
